{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ watermelon (+ canada canadian ontario) (+ shortage scarce \"short supply\") (+ weather rain drought harvest crop growers))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_37_545908399#9_1175888136","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2816","rank":1,"snippet":"<cover>shortage of kids bikes at the moment so this article contains some bikes that we have found in stock that might not be ‘full blown’ mountain bikes but are certainly capable of riding off-road trails and tracks. Please note, retailers stock levels are changing constantly – a handful of bikes may come into stock but demand is extremely high so they won’t be around for long. Vitus Nucleus 24″ 2021 MTB (£500) Cycle Sprog reviewed and recommended brand Vitus Nucleus 24 Key data: Orbea MX24 Team 2021 (£399) Orbea MX24 Team 2021 Key Data: Kona Hula 24 (£519) Kona Hula Key data: Islabikes Creig 24 mountain bike (RRP £899) Cycle Sprog reviewed and recommended bike Isla Creig 24 Key data: Advert: If you've got an outgrown Islabike that you haven't got round to selling on, why not get a quotation today from The Bike Club? They'll even send a courier with a bike box to come and collect it from you. Cube Acid 240 2021 MTB range (from £349) CYCLE SPROG REVIEWED AND RECOMMENDED BRAND Cube Acid 240 2021 Key Data: Frog MTB 62 (rrp £630) Cycle Sprog Reviewed and Recommended bike Frog MTB 62 Key </cover>"}}
