{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ watermelon (+ \"late start\" \"started late\" delayed) (+ weather production supply prices))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_04_1418470079#2_2870983160","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2818","rank":1,"snippet":"3121.000000 , \"headings\": \"Time is ripe to buy Texas watermelons Time is ripe to buy Texas watermelons A ripe time to buy Texas watermelons \" , \"segment\": \"Consumers, on the other hand, could catch a break. Many watermelons are available at chain stores for under $4, less than the price for medium-size watermelons last year, Anderson said. \\\"I think shoppers can find good value in watermelons this year,\\\" said Bob Morrissey, executive director of the National <cover>Watermelon Association. He said the southwest region, including Texas, Arizona and California, have had good production this season, though some parts of the region started late </cover>because of weather problems. Those delays increased output in the summer months, which is part of the reason an oversupply has arisen now, officials said. Most Popular Without mask requirements, essential workers in Texas and Mississippi say they feel more vulnerable than ever Houston soldier to be featured on new season of 'American Idol' Biden administration rushes to accommodate border surge, with few signs of plans to contain it JetBlue Bans Overhead Bin Access for “Basic” Passengers Elon Musk tweets plans to create Texas city named 'Starbase'"}}
